    <ns0:content type="html">&lt;h2&gt;&lt;g-emoji class="g-emoji" alias="warning"&gt;⚠️&lt;/g-emoji&gt; v1.12.0 is an accidental duplicate of v1.11.0&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;During the v1.11.0 release, &lt;code&gt;VERSION&lt;/code&gt; was bumped to &lt;code&gt;1.12.0&lt;/code&gt; instead of &lt;code&gt;1.12.0.dev0&lt;/code&gt;. Our publish workflow fires on any push to &lt;code&gt;main&lt;/code&gt; that touches &lt;code&gt;VERSION&lt;/code&gt; and only skips the upload when the version contains &lt;code&gt;"dev"&lt;/code&gt;, so</ns0:content>
